# Test: the AS112 watchdog probe targets an unreachable anycast service address, not loopback.
# The compiled probe invokes the real request as112 healthcheck command over SSH.
# VALIDATES: the failing anycast probe reaches DOWN and never announces the watched route.
# PREVENTS: loopback health from masking an unreachable anycast path.

cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=ze-test fixture plugin/as112-probe-anycast-not-loopback:timeout=30s
expect=exit:code=0
